Stanzas trickle from ma-mouth you hear it?
Stance: Wide- flickin in n out you fear it?
Low bars doesn't mean my bar is set low-
Hurdle high dare to fly don't try to run bro

Yes those were some epic rap lyrics I wrote =F0=9F=94=A5=F0=9F=94=A5 Lowkey=
 harder to write rap
than traditional poetry

Anyways it's been an awesome week. We were able to have lessons with our
friends and 2 of them came to church! Huge steps for Gobo!

Sunday was a highlight not just because of two friends coming to church,
but 4 dudes from America also pulled up on a trip! Even though they
understood little, they testified about the spirit they felt.

A fun thing from this week was going to Tanabe and meeting a bunch of kids
by the beach! We somehow got put into their friend group chat and we even
made a tik tok with them. So lit

This Pday was cool too! The Senior couple the McArthurs took us with their
grandkids up to a place called Koyasan, and it had a bunch of sweet shrines
and stuff. While there, I was able to talk with two Japanese guys (one of
which loves Welcome to Demon School!!) And get their contact info, and I
randomly met a non-member couple from Provo Utah!! The guy even used to
live in Lindon for a few months! I didn't get to share all that much
besides how awesome a mission is, but I believe it left an impression.

I'm probably leaving Gobo this next transfer, heading into my last two in a
new area... or old one...

We will see! I love you! I promise that God loves us and blesses us as we
trust Him and put effort into doing His will.

Toodleoo!

